<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/35/eng@/~part_IV__cl_11__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/35/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/35/eng@/~part_IV__cl_11__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "An application for a licence shall be made to the Director General in such manner as the Director General shall determine within three years from the date the approval is granted in respect of the private aged healthcare facilities and services to which the application for licence relates or such extended period as the Director General may allow."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/35/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/35/eng@/~part_IV__cl_11__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/35/eng@/~part_IV__cl_11> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/35/eng@> .
