<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/35/eng@/~part_IV__cl_11__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "An application for a licence shall be accompanied by the prescribed fee."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/35/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/35/eng@/~part_IV__cl_11__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/35/eng@/~part_IV__cl_11> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/35/eng@> .
