<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/35/eng@/~part_IV__cl_11__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Where no application for a licence is made within the period specified in subsection (2) the approval shall be deemed revoked. Refusal to process application for licence"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/35/eng@> .
