<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/35/eng@/~part_IV__cl_15__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The remedial works under subsection (1) shall be carried out within twelve months from the date the interim licence is granted or such extended period as the Director General may allow."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/35/eng@> .
