<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/35/eng@/~part_IV__cl_15__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "An interim licensee may at any time during the period specified in subsection (4) notify the Director General of his compliance with the standards or requirements."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/35/eng@> .
