<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/35/eng@/~part_IX__cl_53__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/35/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/35/eng@/~part_IX__cl_53__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Any decision, order, appeal, direction, investigation, trial and proceedings done, taken or commenced under the Care Centres Act 1993 relating to the care centre under subsection (1) immediately before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall be continued or concluded under and in accordance with the provisions of the Care Centres Act 1993."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/35/eng@> .
